# ===================== 客户端构建产物（deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app） =====================
# 客户端最终产物（Web 部署包、Windows Release 产物）统一输出至 deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app，
# 与后端 jar（*.jar）策略一致：产物不入库，仅保留 .gitkeep 占位文件保证目录结构可追踪。
# 注意：必须带 deploy/ 路径前缀，避免误伤 cloudoffice-flutter-app/web、windows 客户端源码目录。
deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app/web/*
!deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app/web/.gitkeep
deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app/windows/*
!deploy/cloudoffice-flutter-app/windows/.gitkeep

